A '''prison ship''', also known as a '''correctional vessel''', a '''dungeon ship''', or '''prison transport''', was a type of [[starship]] used to contain and transport [[prisoner]]s. During the [[Clone Wars]], the [[Galactic Republic]]'s [[Republic Correctional Authority|Correctional Authority]] maintained such craft.<ref name="Rise">''[[Rise of the Separatists]]''</ref> Much later in the [[New Republic Era]], the [[New Republic]] used a specific [[New Republic Correctional Transport|model]] of prison ship crewed mainly by [[droid]]s.<ref name="Chapter 6">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 6: The Prisoner}}</ref> The [[Knights of Ren]] flew an [[Oubliette-class transport|''Oubliette''-class transport]], manufactured by [[Osseriton Assemblages]] the penal world [[Osseriton]] as a prison [[transport]].<ref name="TROS VD">''[[Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref>

